From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:24:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] LvglDisplayEngineDxe: Give the Compatibility category an icon

The setup menu of ouroBIOS has a sixth category, Compatibility, with the
options for macOS and the advanced ones: crossing arrows in orange on
the front page, as the other categories have their own symbol.

TEST=tools/build.sh menu and tools/qemu-smoke.py of ouroBIOS at every
build; the screenshots of tools/qemu-setup-shots.py; the setup of the
W541 since v1.3.10-rc12.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv

---
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c b/LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c
index e8b67ef..de5df29 100644
--- a/LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c
+++ b/LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c
@@ -581,6 +581,7 @@ LookupPromptIcon (
     { "Console",              LV_SYMBOL_FILE,         THEME_COLOR_ICON_GRAY   },
     { "Sound",                LV_SYMBOL_VOLUME_MAX,   THEME_COLOR_ICON_PINK   },
     { "Graphics",             LV_SYMBOL_IMAGE,        THEME_COLOR_ICON_TEAL   },
+    { "Compatibility",        LV_SYMBOL_SHUFFLE,      THEME_COLOR_ICON_ORANGE },
     { "Reboot",               LV_SYMBOL_POWER,     THEME_COLOR_ICON_RED    },
     { "Commit",               LV_SYMBOL_OK,        THEME_COLOR_ICON_GREEN  },
     { "Discard",              LV_SYMBOL_CLOSE,     THEME_COLOR_ICON_RED    },
